\newlabel{tab:matched}{{7}{11}{\textbf {Matched-output control in the reaching monkeys} (tuned penalty). Median retention of the renormalized fixed decoder and after re-weighting, and the share of the loss recovered by re-weighting (\%), when decoding hand kinematics (four outputs) or hand-movement direction only (a two-dimensional unit vector, as for the human participants)}{table.7}{}}
